/-! ### Images of the three generators -/

/- Each image is given by the table of its images, packed as in the model file: 136 hexadecimal
rows of 30 entries of three digits (the last row holds 10), the entry of the point `30 * r + j`
being the group of three digits of row `r` in position `j` counted from the right, read as the
field `30 * r + j` of width `12` of the natural number having the rows as its digits in base
`2 ^ 360`. The image of `u` has order `4` and a second table for its preimages, since its inverse
occurs forty times in the relators; the images of `v` and `t` are involutions. As in the model
file, statements about all the points are checked at the points `70 * q + r` with `q < 58` and
`r < 70`. The bodies are exposed so that importing modules can compute with the three
permutations. -/

/-- The image of the generator `u` of the presentation of `Ru`, of index zero: a permutation of
order `4` of the `4060` points. Entry `i` of the first table is the image of the point `i`, and
entry `i` of the second table is its preimage. -/
